# Avalon 2 Mines — enemy air unit, id 12 (`Avalon2_4`): five-`Mine` rack, no gun.
# Rig transcribed verbatim from the decompiled `com.enemy.Avalon2_4.init()`
# (session export of design/noAds.swf):
#
#   Mine  : centre (-67, +5)   Mine a: centre (-43, +11)
#   Mine b: centre (-15, +16)  Mine c: centre (+16, +13)
#   Mine d: centre (  ?, +5)  <- APPROXIMATED, see the note below
#
# Offsets are Flash (y-DOWN) relative to the UNIT ORIGIN; bitmaps are placed by
# their TOP-LEFT and then centred, so the lines above resolve each to a CENTRE.
# This prefab's ROOT is the body sprite (Flash centre (0, -5)), so every
# child below is rebased onto that centre and flipped to pix3 y-up:
#   pix3 = (fx, -(fy + 5))
#
# APPROXIMATION:
#   the FIFTH mine's x is the one offset the decompiler lost (`x -= ((w>>1) - ?)`);
#   it is placed at +44 to continue the rack's arc (-67, -43, -15, +16, +44 with
#   y +5, +11, +16, +13, +5), which is symmetric with the first mine's height.
#
# Per-id stats (hp/speed/score/attack) are applied by WaveSpawner from SdBalance.
# GENERATED by scripts/gen-levels.mjs — edit the rig table there, not this file.
version: 1.0.0
metadata:
  author: Sky Defender Remaster
  description: "Avalon 2 Mines (unit prefab, Avalon2_4)"
